Package: pprofR
Type: Package
Title: Shared Modelling, Testing and Standardized Measures for KECC Quality Measures
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-09-24
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yubo", "Shao", email = "ybshao@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A single shared engine for the fixed provider effects logistic
    model used by the KECC quality measures (AOH, PPPW, SFR, SRR). Supports
    binary and binomial outcomes (number of trials 'N', default 1), the
    SerBIN and BAN Newton-Raphson algorithms, provider-effect tests (exact
    Poisson-binomial, exact bootstrap, Wald, score, and patient-clustered
    robust and stabilized Wald and score tests),
    covariate tests (Wald, robust Wald,
    likelihood ratio, score), direct and indirect standardized ratios and
    rates with standard errors, measure-level z-tests and confidence
    intervals. Derived from the 'pprof' package
    <https://github.com/UM-KevinHe/pprof>; see Wu et al. (2022)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.9387>.
